---
import { DISCORD } from '../lib/site';
---
<section class="wrap" id="beta">
  <div class="glass relative overflow-hidden p-8 sm:p-12" data-reveal>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -right-24 -top-24 size-72 rounded-full bg-honey/20 blur-3xl"></div>
    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> Coming soon</span>
    <h2 class="h-section mt-4 max-w-2xl">Hive v0.0.1 is on the way.</h2>
    <p class="lead mt-5 max-w-2xl">We’re preparing Hive’s first public release. The launch date, installer, and release notes will be posted here when v0.0.1 is ready.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a href="/changelog" class="btn btn-primary">Read the changelog</a>
      <a href={DISCORD} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-ghost">Join the community</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
